Generated by `scripts/generate_e8_t_axis_mixed_coefficients.py`.
The polynomial source is `B*C - B*D - 2*B*A + D*A + C*A`, with
`A=Q(t)`, `B=Q(2*s+t)`, `C=Q(s+t)`, and `D=Q(s)`.
Each `(i,j)` uses the raw bivariate Leibniz rule, with no factorial
normalization.  All cases with `j >= 1` and `i+j <= 5` are included.
-/

